{:activity/_scope [{:activity/expected-seconds 420.0 :activity/first-step {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060662} :activity/id #uuid "57e9a8cd-9225-5fac-965e-807daa0874c9" :activity/scope {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049151} :activity/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060662 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060935 :tutorial/content "Remember that we can represent a system of two linear equations in two variables using matrices. We can do the same thing for a system of three linear equations in three variables, such as the following:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y\\text{ }-\\text{ }2z &=7 \\\\ 2x\\text{ }-\\text{ }1y\\text{ }-\\text{ }4z &=2 \\\\ 2x+1y\\text{ }-\\text{ }3z &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFor a $3 \\times 3$ system like the one above, we put the coefficients of the system into a $3 \\times 3$ coefficient matrix:\n\n![](images/40/40541d2ecb10c763056ae72734e723a9d5967ed9accaf0bbde6f2a2f9ec96b65.svg)\n\nEach row has the coefficients of one of the equations in the system, and each column consists of the coefficients of one particular variable.\nWe also have the $3 \\times 1$ column vectors\n\n![](images/e5/e56ed72d2d17f9a4bc59bfe51a96534a72ebe481a312b8e9c6c028ade96d3748.svg)\n\nwhere $\\mathbf{b}$ consists of each constant on the right side of the system and $\\mathbf{x}$ contains the variables.\nWith these matrices, we can write our system as $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ or\n\n![](images/f0/f06e5a54e106bcdca8b5cbad677ade3476ba8f6218b4aa79d196f54e0fff3e2c.svg)\n\nWe can write any system of three equations with three variables in this form. Just to check that the above equation is true, let's multiply out the left-hand side to see if it equals the right-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -1 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3x+2y\\text{ }-\\text{ }2z \\\\ 2x\\text{ }-\\text{ }1y\\text{ }-\\text{ }4z \\\\ 2x+1y\\text{ }-\\text{ }3z\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =b\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :tutorial/id #uuid "93427b42-9f68-58e3-a3fd-19c5c8c58d90" :tutorial/math-academy-id 3053 :tutorial/title "Introduction"} :step/id #uuid "944c9195-2d49-5b9d-bc5c-1cd47e01dc13" :step/math-academy-id 16480 :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060663}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060663 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059757 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059566 :question/id #uuid "7bfcfcbb-6212-5f9b-90aa-c79fbf7221e9" :question/math-academy-id "e-4518" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}6x+4y &=1 \\\\ x-8y-z &=-2 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n![](images/21/212a3beac5ede3786bad835a693b0a725f331de41d6969dce7f17925dde012d7.svg)\n\nWhat are the values of $a,$ $b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}6x+4y+0z &=1 \\\\ x-8y-z &=-2 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n![](images/22/22034036ec7859b56e9e19124e33fa616eddfc3784e15f8074583e28253a4bae.svg)\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n![](images/b5/b5e0f47e7c4bb15e8923bceb665dcc87944090e3a39f9a335b17ab0b85025cc8.svg)\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n![](images/b6/b643463daef16c2179d6f6320d31353a23b042f3774295eb55e48af0242ec655.svg)\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n![](images/bf/bf8fb79fd8998c5c867fc371535e26f2e92bea5fa7262789bd44aea07e24f93c.svg)\n\nTherefore, $a=6,$ $b=2,$ and $c=-2.$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050463} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050825}] :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060276 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "099fa1e0-d872-5eb5-81ed-b3b1edaada04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-6,\\,c=11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321222} {:answer/id #uuid "138e861a-0cc2-58a9-9676-1ec3e92f91ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-6,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321303} {:answer/id #uuid "7024eba8-43e2-5236-ad74-99d0c32d9f47" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-4,\\,b=-4,\\,c=11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322019} {:answer/id #uuid "806f8895-3e66-5150-bdff-c12b2f1ea7b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=11,\\,c=-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322157} {:answer/id #uuid "ce2f6adf-c8fe-58ac-9550-1c74ef4b3ac8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=11,\\,b=-4,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322755}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186321222} :answer-field/id #uuid "dbe13b71-8293-5712-8025-31df3dbc7ef9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186323607}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "5006a5f1-0a5e-50bb-a47b-7da41b1e709f" :question/math-academy-id "q-36181" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y+z &=2 \\\\ x-6y+11z &=3 \\\\ 3x-4y-z &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 & a \\\\ 1 & b & c \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "We can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 11 \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 11 \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=1,\\,b=-6,\\,c=11.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060277 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "95c60b2a-194d-505f-801d-b642b8d5f5ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 6, b =-8, c =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058285} {:answer/id #uuid "0883bc07-91cf-5cb0-94a7-a183fb2b8093" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 5, b = 8, c = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058286} {:answer/id #uuid "16cdaee5-2022-5f46-b3a5-8ab4a158cad4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 5, b = 8, c =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058287} {:answer/id #uuid "28f939ee-f0c9-599c-834a-2bd50f55c7ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 6, b = 0, c = 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058288} {:answer/id #uuid "30ddafd0-59d6-557e-b5af-a34b20845676" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 5, b =-4, c = 7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058289}] :answer-field/id #uuid "15271f0f-aeb5-5bda-944e-c54b67eef4d0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058284}] :question/id #uuid "61d02474-f2c0-5a11-b107-93d690d3e573" :question/math-academy-id "q-36184" :question/problem "The system of equations\n${2x + 6y + 5z = 3; x - 4y + 8z = 1; - 2y + 8z = 7$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n$\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 6 & a \\\\ 1 & -4 & b \\\\ c & -2 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhat are the values of $a, b$ and $c$?"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237776 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8b883705-4f13-564f-a1ef-126507d3f930" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=2,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236693} {:answer/id #uuid "ab2c609e-ade1-504f-b56a-cbe1ca68518e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=1,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236899} {:answer/id #uuid "c3feefde-7b37-5a86-8f6e-b0c208a50961" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=2,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237055} {:answer/id #uuid "ef6c207b-ce5d-57b0-82bc-7b3988df6723" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=1,\\,c=-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237330} {:answer/id #uuid "f669d9e4-9bbe-5b98-a671-93ce001f7f05" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=1,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237372}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237372} :answer-field/id #uuid "16abb40e-e765-53e3-90ea-7a181a9af49c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237465}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "9047fc55-30cd-5bc7-96fe-e8f5b01aa182" :question/math-academy-id "q-10004" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y+2z &=0 \\\\ x+2y+3z &=2 \\\\ 3x+y+z &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & a & 2 \\\\ b & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1 & c\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}0x+y+2z &=0 \\\\ x+2y+3z &=2 \\\\ 3x+y+z &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=1,\\,b=1,\\,c=1.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265929 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "261340b2-1a0d-59dd-8b7b-76c4f7bfb121" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=4,\\,b=-3,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263331} {:answer/id #uuid "3823e286-9476-5d05-a64b-0bd2a3d821f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=4,\\,b=-1,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263509} {:answer/id #uuid "6457994c-cd91-5a4c-915f-080f701162d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=-5,\\,c=9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263869} {:answer/id #uuid "aa7ea0e9-94d6-53d4-928a-c09488c89e60" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=-3,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264456} {:answer/id #uuid "fa260fff-d100-5b94-a5b3-239f605d176d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=-7,\\,c=-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265190}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186263331} :answer-field/id #uuid "a814f1c0-7e30-52d3-b5a0-1628f163bffe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265547}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "585d1fdd-e4b6-5cfa-bfaf-54e4bf0c7de2" :question/math-academy-id "q-130535" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y+z &=1 \\\\ -x-3y+9z &=-2 \\\\ 4x-7y-z &=5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 & c \\\\ -1 & b & 9 \\\\ a & -7 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "We can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -3 & 9 \\\\ 4 & -7 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 9 \\\\ 4 & -7 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=4,\\,b=-3,\\,c=1.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265930 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "61b6213e-6630-5cbc-a2be-bba26537e9d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-3,\\,b=1,\\,c=2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263842} {:answer/id #uuid "98683e89-44c4-5b63-a6a0-5143070e1a4e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-4,\\,b=8,\\,c=-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264311} {:answer/id #uuid "a16f2ca2-4f2e-5acc-9b55-06d4bbfa6420" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=8,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264374} {:answer/id #uuid "dc08dfd2-1ae1-53cb-adad-40873d7ac878" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=7,\\,c=8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264916} {:answer/id #uuid "f9db3e03-47ba-53e0-8851-1e7f8c0aa7b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-6,\\,b=8,\\,c=5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265185}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265185} :answer-field/id #uuid "21ecd5d5-730f-53a8-b7fd-5892a28e6ac7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265304}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "718180b1-bf73-575f-add7-0f6c8d9bba0d" :question/math-academy-id "q-130536" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3x+y+7z &=5 \\\\ x-4y+8z &=1 \\\\ -6y+9z &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -4 & b \\\\ 0 & a & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}c \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b,$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3x+y+7z &=5 \\\\ x-4y+8z &=1 \\\\ 0x-6y+9z &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-6,\\,b=8,\\,c=5.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292857 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "505018d9-5f40-5fe6-a2bd-8371d403497f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290974}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186290974} :answer-field/id #uuid "31adadd0-5d60-5f06-b25f-16789378a818" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291902} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d591b4c2-08ff-5aaa-b44a-f770b77524f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291529}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186291529} :answer-field/id #uuid "4fcd008a-d164-500a-b986-f81a0ace138f" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291982} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "50e80a16-e3c8-55c9-9435-066d6712c90c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290977}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186290977} :answer-field/id #uuid "9b8794de-38d3-5c1e-a536-6f39850c2a60" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292226} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bff71819-0595-5166-8e24-1cbd5f3a41e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291459}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186291459} :answer-field/id #uuid "db86b1f5-873e-5caf-abb7-1046d566f145" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292417}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "d46bf19a-ed33-55bb-809b-da0d9d2e99d7" :question/math-academy-id "q-275511" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y+2z &=5 \\\\ 2x+6y+5z &=22 \\\\ x-2y-3z &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $1$ | {{field-1}} | $2$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $5$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | {{field-2}} | $6$ | $5$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} |  | . |\n|  |  | $1$ | $-2$ | {{field-4}} |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $-1$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y+2z &=5 \\\\ 2x+6y+5z &=22 \\\\ x-2y-3z &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 6 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 22 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 6 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 22 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299537 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "85806f6e-3f8d-56f5-8841-0e3c0a47083a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298128}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298128} :answer-field/id #uuid "4f730fa1-b5c3-50b2-9976-270a3b0b824a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298906} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "97ab1973-03cd-5f88-a18f-9217286fd9f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298209}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298209} :answer-field/id #uuid "6bda87eb-624b-5dc0-a615-09034a4dd617" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298994} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7150ff71-c085-5d5f-84bc-cd85d9ef931f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298040}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298040} :answer-field/id #uuid "8c396013-8c55-5d91-a811-c1d7554b13b5" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299104} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "91f9c034-96b3-537d-95ac-54136e6ff76c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298185}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298185} :answer-field/id #uuid "cda9e946