-- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $0$ | $1$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $-2$ |  | . |\n|  |  | $1$ | $-1$ | {{field-3}} |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-2y+4z &=6 \\\\ 0x+y-9z &=-2 \\\\ x-y-8z &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -9 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -9 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299543 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5510c154-3113-560a-8cf0-83caa9efea50" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297912}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297912} :answer-field/id #uuid "7795747f-e066-5d98-a24b-085152f86178" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299041} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fbf70d4b-56c0-5110-93db-42d6d4351c2f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298630}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298630} :answer-field/id #uuid "b581bc5d-0b52-5256-bd4e-757f72f21eb1" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299248} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "be40857b-1b46-54d7-ac9f-dbda15960900" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298387}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298387} :answer-field/id #uuid "d84a58da-15d7-5014-998c-4c379a5a9b0e" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299370} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2c1b3515-83dc-59c4-a35a-ba9822e7aa1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297737}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297737} :answer-field/id #uuid "e654fd9b-16cb-5bd2-a144-8c1fcfcba66b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299418}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "fdc83295-a0d8-5214-8d8a-53da62122338" :question/math-academy-id "q-316987" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+6z &=-1 \\\\ -2x+3y &=0 \\\\ x-9y+z &=5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} | $-4$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | {{field-3}} |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $-2$ | $3$ | $0$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $0$ |  | . |\n|  |  | $1$ | {{field-4}} | $1$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $5$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+6z &=-1 \\\\ -2x+3y+0z &=0 \\\\ x-9y+z &=5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -4 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -9 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -4 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -9 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299544 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5be3b387-a266-5aef-899d-85c5377ba9fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297938}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297938} :answer-field/id #uuid "203e627b-9f75-5b76-a0ab-096b78718564" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298746} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "86c12b43-c774-58d9-bd02-2ab96f8e6903" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298135}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298135} :answer-field/id #uuid "22eb6f77-fd16-5651-97c6-7d63f3adaf57" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298752} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "66b5ad57-dc18-5e85-ba08-dbda00deb359" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297991}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297991} :answer-field/id #uuid "29ad4e84-d621-57b6-bdae-77fe81fbaa1b" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298778} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "78b85a30-9de2-50c6-a767-5b60e5b58864" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298078}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298078} :answer-field/id #uuid "fd5b91bc-ade9-59ac-8c07-12895838c90f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299489}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "ef62913f-f81f-5097-a782-135c7f2dd1c5" :question/math-academy-id "q-316988" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-y &=14 \\\\ 3x+3y+z &=3 \\\\ 5x-8y+4z &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $2$ | $-1$ | {{field-1}} |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $14$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | {{field-2}} | $3$ | $1$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-4}} | $-8$ | $4$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $-7$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-y+0z &=14 \\\\ 3x+3y+z &=3 \\\\ 5x-8y+4z &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -8 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -8 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299545 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "90810e02-0687-5005-aef3-a9c986a2dc63" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298180}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298180} :answer-field/id #uuid "28f913b0-91a5-5a4e-b820-e56ee0ab3552" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298776} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f27590c5-ac97-5a60-b356-17ac9e7851e8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298579}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298579} :answer-field/id #uuid "3acdda22-e8f4-5926-b02d-be99c2c76678" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298836} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "78bf7cdc-6fd6-5b9d-8c92-76ba31451e58" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298079}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298079} :answer-field/id #uuid "3ea11df4-bfaa-5c38-b5d2-d365a00c5072" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298853} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5c1170d1-dcac-5d19-bbbd-9913e202bfc4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297939}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297939} :answer-field/id #uuid "ae0df92d-6c62-5369-b334-e4aa53fcfccf" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299224}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "5499f06c-38bc-500b-a6b2-4b8990d9fe9f" :question/math-academy-id "q-316995" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x &=6 \\\\ 2x+z &=2 \\\\ 3x+4y-2z &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} | $0$ | $0$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $6$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $2$ | {{field-2}} | $1$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $2$ |  | . |\n|  |  | $3$ | {{field-3}} | $-2$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+0y+0z &=6 \\\\ 2x+0y+z &=2 \\\\ 3x+4y-2z &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299546 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6537e42b-8a1c-5a7c-a039-e705f23b1b3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297984}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297984} :answer-field/id #uuid "33c2f659-bbef-59b6-bb94-e61266349456" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298813} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "69121421-2c36-56c2-896a-3c8729d666f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298002}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298002} :answer-field/id #uuid "3fabd7ed-2f97-51ad-824a-e556f7609e14" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298857} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fcc15c8c-b786-5904-ba29-0cac6d27cd1d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298635}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298635} :answer-field/id #uuid "c35716a7-702a-5b1c-a00c-2c29a802cc9b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299292} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e9815437-135f-5aca-9a41-723aa73cac41" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298545}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298545} :answer-field/id #uuid "ce25fded-a08a-58fc-9d7c-ebd368e6c675" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299326}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "e9d7caea-9c02-533d-9b0d-d992c80e7e34" :question/math-academy-id "q-316996" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y-z &=1 \\\\ y-3z &=0 \\\\ 4z &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $3$ | $2$ | $-1$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $1$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | {{field-1}} | $1$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $0$ |  | . |\n|  |  | $0$ | {{field-3}} | $4$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y-z &=1 \\\\ 0x+y-3z &=0 \\\\ 0x+0y+4z &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186323765 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5ce51d3d-741a-5369-986e-eefed5ac9f85" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-4,\\,b=0,\\,c=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321883} {:answer/id #uuid "7ca0482f-4c6e-5b47-9cb6-8938fc8f2f8f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=7,\\,c=-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322128} {:answer/id #uuid "8383a234-7ee7-5c7c-b65b-25632a4d878c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=3,\\,b=4,\\,c=7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322184} {:answer/id #uuid "89c3a6e4-255a-5b64-b610-f937bd99d980" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-4,\\,b=-5,\\,c=8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322246} {:answer/id #uuid "9a9951b6-2f89-5a28-89c6-2fbd021d5540" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=8,\\,b=-5,\\,c=-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322374}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186322374} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa7d2367-57ba-5860-a0e9-b45ec2c3a521" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186323660}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "075fd7f5-bea7-5040-92fa-5b19399df625" :question/math-academy-id "q-36178" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y+8z &=0 \\\\ 2x-5y+4z &=3 \\\\ 5x-4y+7z &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & a \\\\ 2 & b & 4 \\\\ 5 & c & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "We can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & 8 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 5 & -4 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & 8 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 5 & -4 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=8,\\,b=-5,\\,c=-4.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186426755 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01601b6f-c05d-574c-9a4a-d776d7830de4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=3,\\,b=-1,\\,c=2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426727} {:answer/id #uuid "4d9e88a0-7c5e-5e8c-9e9a-14296af074a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=-1,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426732} {:answer/id #uuid "a3f35897-b61a-57d6-81d6-9ea4cf4754e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=1,\\,c=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426735} {:answer/id #uuid "df865a24-76e9-5e0c-aef0-ccb73198892d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-3,\\,b=1,\\,c=2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426739} {:answer/id #uuid "f375eeb9-cae0-5b47-8162-0ab390a8e5ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=3,\\,c=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426742}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186426727} :answer-field/id #uuid "456a058b-2a76-50e4-b196-28caf276666d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426748}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "06d7e42a-14b7-5ba4-9656-a3c1d06d273b" :question/math-academy-id "q-10006" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-z &=0 \\\\ x+y+3z &=2 \\\\ 3x-2y+z &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & b \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ a & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ c \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+0y-z &=0 \\\\ x+y+3z &=2 \\\\ 3x-2y+z &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=3,\\,b=-1,\\,c=2.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186426758 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "223847b6-00fc-5235-8827-7e678d11053d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-3,\\,c=2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426731} {:answer/id #uuid "62f10e81-bf0b-5d8f-abd5-66b9009b22b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-3,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426733} {:answer/id #uuid "ca5cbda7-94a5-56d2-8e39-bf95cd46be03" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=5,\\,b=0,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426736} {:answer/id #uuid "ccaa4421-7462-521e-bd86-4c7357d0d8ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=-1,\\,c=5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426737} {:answer/id #uuid "fc3f9e0f-2358-5b78-8d1f-f66161800384" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=-4,\\,c=5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426744}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186426737} :answer-field/id #uuid "83a4688c-a103-5974-9014-77e44fbfd4ee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426751}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "da13acd8-77ae-5f2b-ba9c-504353353d52" :question/math-academy-id "q-36179" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+5z &=5 \\\\ -x+5y-3z &=2 \\\\ x-4y+7z &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & a & 5 \\\\ b & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}c \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+0y+5z &=5 \\\\ -x+5y-3z &=2 \\\\ x-4y+7z &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=0,\\,b=-1,\\,c=5.$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations"} :step/id #uuid "c9335040-4892-53be-90b2-54e91913879f" :step/math-academy-id 16482 :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060664}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060664 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059758 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059567 :question/id #uuid "c4af8b0d-e4ee-56f4-9cf6-594530639339" :question/math-academy-id "e-4519" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-y+z &=4 \\\\ z-x+2 &=-1 \\\\ 2y-2x-4z &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n![](images/22/228e4520f4301ac7acb7eef54fad6dcc8ce9bbf43d48124a761978dfcea6423b.svg)\nWhat are the values of $a,$ $b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-y+z &=4 \\\\ -x+0y+z &=-3 \\\\ -2x+2y-4z &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n![](images/80/80100c3398fa2eac3a07696dd30354c3c971f0650ab32d67a958492ed1cbdeae.svg)\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n![](images/8f/8f7fdfc0426ad23a34e6d7f2915181a88a63ea74da93b2b6bd718e03f21ba8d2.svg)\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n![](images/28/2867d40f70d0e042e522e1bb14ea8af830e42f22a63cc482ba67923c51807312.svg)\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n![](images/9a/9a4c39673ffd559b35ed9dbf0e465f6a8714c0d9a467178a51e1f6ad79a81445.svg)\n\nTherefore $a=0,$ $b=-2,$ $c=-3.$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059953 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8520c3ec-4c15-50b8-a223-215b84117916" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 0, b =-5, c = 3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056078} {:answer/id #uuid "c054a405-cfc8-5d5f-9ac0-022f66c16931" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 3, b = 5, c =-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056079} {:answer/id #uuid "ca263a82-b264-514f-9aa3-5c88fa6e33cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 0, b =-5, c = 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056080} {:answer/id #uuid "4ccb20d2-3443-5bc1-8956-1b0a07adcd27" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 3, b = 5, c = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056081} {:answer/id #uuid "74ba787c-95b8-57a2-b861-ace5bfec105b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 0, b = 5, c =-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056082}] :answer-field/id #uuid "0c1f700f-344d-5617-a2a8-e1023b26f6de" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056077}] :question/id #uuid "6a1b7a71-ea24-5f1c-be92-41b7146b85c5" :question/math-academy-id "q-10000" :question/problem "The system of equations\n${2y + 3z =-1 - x; 4y =-5z; x + 6z - 3 = 0$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & b \\\\ 1 & a & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}c \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhat are the values of $a, b$ and $c$?"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060451 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d5c13e1d-6bcd-56d3-a766-b556b263fc53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 2, b = 0, c = 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059329} {:answer/id #uuid "ee582995-801a-5dee-b283-78fb41347fce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 6, b = 0, c = 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059330} {:answer/id #uuid "fe4215d1-5294-56ca-91f0-4ab7fcf1005d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a =-1, b = 1, c =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059331} {:answer/id #uuid "579b9fda-559b-50ac-9974-6dd31ab1a37c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 1, b = 3, c = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059332} {:answer/id #uuid "69c48b55-0366-5095-bf96-0b91c24943b2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 1, b = 0, c = 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059333}] :answer-field/id #uuid "4c21af52-dff9-509e-a7d4-a22fd4d7499f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059328}] :question/id #uuid "0ad9c62f-7c03-5fbc-ab09-c5cd0fac325b" :question/math-academy-id "q-9721" :question/problem "The system of equations\n${x = 6; y - x - 2z = 0; 3z - 2x - 5 =-3$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}a & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & b & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 0 \\\\ c\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhat are the values of $a, b$ and $c$?"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265931 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04724195-4099-5efd-b607-d0a6ec716d82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-7,\\,c=8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263041} {:answer/id #uuid "380da7e9-21d4-5706-85a2-87915110a7ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-3,\\,b=5,\\,c=8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263505} {:answer/id #uuid "5c6ee337-2032-500b-8abc-6c320f482b06" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-3,\\,b=1,\\,c=6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263797} {:answer/id #uuid "8e82e001-fb77-5f38-9119-eb4019601441" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=4,\\,b=1,\\,c=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264219} {:answer/id #uuid "bb46b3af-c697-5f07-8ba2-d5f423b58e3b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-7,\\,b=1,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264628}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186263797} :answer-field/id #uuid "2addae70-3713-5e28-bf38-96a976994060" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265322}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "6babd892-4ff5-50c6-9630-e42df64db024" :question/math-academy-id "q-130562" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}z-7x-5 &=0 \\\\ 4y-x-3z-2 &=0 \\\\ 2y+x-8 &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & a \\\\ b & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ c\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b,$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-7x+0y+z &=5 \\\\ -x+4y-3z &=2 \\\\ x+2y+0z &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-3,\\,b=1,\\,c=6.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299547 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "43fddea3-d0f8-5695-aeca-4914b81fc7dc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297828}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297828} :answer-field/id #uuid "07d63cfd-2c70-56f1-91e5-6b0a54a598e7" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298661} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5e6f4ae6-5078-5a23-8d05-43bfab7668c9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297949}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297949} :answer-field/id #uuid "1d90e8c9-82f6-5108-bd2d-cc950fdc0758" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298741} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bf2cb796-ed04-5c16-a021-89dd5f064140" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298391}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298391} :answer-field/id #uuid "5fe819ce-fd88-59b2-8385-d30f01206bb9" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298965} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "09ca9278-0c20-567c-a5f8-c1e5fc82c7b2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297603}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297603} :answer-field/id #uuid "acafd20b-a624-534c-a948-7dfeb34188c8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299221}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "05df8d85-d4aa-50db-b657-3624538dbf63" :question/math-academy-id "q-316998" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2z-2y-5x &=5 \\\\ -3z+3y+4x &=1 \\\\ 2z-2x+y &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $-5$ | {{field-1}} | $2$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $5$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $4$ | $3$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} |  | . |\n|  |  | $-2$ | {{field-4}} | $2$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $2$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-5x-2y+2z &=5 \\\\ 4x+3y-3z &=1 \\\\ -2x+y+2z &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299629 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ba42191e-a1b2-5cbe-be73-25f0fc307cc0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298362}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298362} :answer-field/id #uuid "34e6ea13-72da-5a50-9831-59f3bb32ec83" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298820} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c62d600f-ef35-5c93-8a98-7c0b5d6bbb92" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298418}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298418} :answer-field/id #uuid "525ad87c-5619-57d3-92a7-8525697b4703" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298915} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "861c6ed2-e966-5692-accb-b534f1e773b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298131}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298131} :answer-field/id #uuid "88962de7-2fa7-50be-bcd3-a4e0c59688f8" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299095} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "146371ee-1c0b-5294-90fc-369dd2c1ae84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297639}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297639} :answer-field/id #uuid "b029a4eb-3160-581a-8813-6eaf9bdeebd7" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299234}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "cdeadc34-e7f3-5a9c-9bba-7c02bc1cee1c" :question/math-academy-id "q-317632" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}5x-3y+4 &=7 \\\\ -2x+6z-1 &=8 \\\\ 7y-5z+2 &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $5$ | {{field-1}} | $0$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | {{field-2}} |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $-2$ | {{field-3}} | $6$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $9$ |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-4}} | $7$ | $-5$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $-5$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}5x-3y+0z &=3 \\\\ -2x+0y+6z &=9 \\\\ 0x+7y-5z &=-5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -3 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -3 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299630 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "05ba1424-91d7-5c62-a094-828e0e888e06" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297580}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297580} :answer-field/id #uuid "3ac9bed5-2877-5551-b039-f9193e28a015" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298835} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f3e6f5c4-a7ca-537a-9ec8-53d03fd09870" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298585}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298585} :answer-field/id #uuid "82b43927-47cb-5708-962f-92a6334680cb" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299080} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d50182a5-b6fe-5d57-9f80-7cea0f222904" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298466}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298466} :answer-field/id #uuid "d89514df-b19e-5584-9382-f92d17e2324c" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299373} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "761736bb-d1a6-5731-b2fe-7aa62385e4b4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298067}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298067} :answer-field/id #uuid "eafd7059-5b8c-5651-85c0-107af3e8ef74" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299430}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "2a4ab7e0-5c2e-51f8-b6d7-195279e97c0b" :question/math-academy-id "q-317639" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4z+x-3 &=7 \\\\ 2x-5y+6 &=1 \\\\ 3y+7z-4x+5 &=10\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $1$ | $0$ | {{field-1}} |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $10$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $2$ | {{field-2}} | $0$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-4}} | $3$ | $7$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $5$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+0y+4z &=10 \\\\ 2x-5y+0z &=-5 \\\\ -4x+3y+7z &=5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345090 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7f237083-5937-5038-bad9-77ea70e93801" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=1,\\,c=-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343329} {:answer/id #uuid "b0defa8e-2bd0-5680-9224-f7c0c461a691" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=-6,\\,c=-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343790} {:answer/id #uuid "d983726b-637f-5b7c-ab9a-c3cab5ebc84f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=5,\\,b=-6,\\,c=-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344147} {:answer/id #uuid "dc559f14-62c7-5112-b64e-3db6ffcf890d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=0,\\,c=-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344171} {:answer/id #uuid "ffa16091-ca19-556d-96fd-e7038dca084c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-3,\\,b=0,\\,c=-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344490}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186344171} :answer-field/id #uuid "898e1d5a-e517-5a40-96be-0bab42faf42d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344734}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "92f08978-289e-50c6-86d9-b99da259f151" :question/math-academy-id "q-75490" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2y+5x &=3z+2 \\\\ 3x-6y &=5 \\\\ 2x-3y+5z &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}5 & a & -3 \\\\ 3 & -6 & b \\\\ 2 & c & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}5x+2y-3z &=2 \\\\ 3x-6y+0z &=5 \\\\ 2x-3y+5z &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 3 & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 3 & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=2,\\,b=0,\\,c=-3.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345093 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14e41fb2-55d9-59c0-8d7c-f479a8daf29f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=1,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342422} {:answer/id #uuid "3e644e7b-9f73-55a8-8088-ba5d368a502e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=1,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342751} {:answer/id #uuid "970abb0a-db98-5266-b7ff-8ce23cc6845c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=1,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343561} {:answer/id #uuid "cd5f7494-f64c-5709-b28f-66c7dc9b3cdb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=0,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344047} {:answer/id #uuid "e03c8288-d5d7-522f-9ee3-0947f2566acf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=0,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344206}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186344047} :answer-field/id #uuid "441d60ff-b630-5cd3-a6e3-c2efc611d92d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344604}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "ef81a3db-1366-5103-83a1-fc5b71b87fc0" :question/math-academy-id "q-75500" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2y+3z &=7 \\\\ x+z &=-1 \\\\ 3z-2x+y &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}a & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & b & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ c\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}0x-2y+3z &=7 \\\\ x+0y+z &=-1 \\\\ -2x+y+3z &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=0,\\,b=0,\\,c=3.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345094 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "21cdd402-ce7c-5613-904f-22ac379b3437" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-2,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342518} {:answer/id #uuid "aaff02a3-ece8-568d-99e1-3b7dde03b1d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=7,\\,c=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343742} {:answer/id #uuid "ca8b4d29-add1-5690-a77f-70